* Feature 13, T4: Record-form only fixture (no named writes)
* This object only writes via record-form UPDATE/DELETE (empty Name gap),
* so it should produce no write-summary lens.
*
* Expected DataAccessEntry output:
*   - Kind=EdgeWrites, Name="", NameRange on empty (record-form UPDATE)
*   - Kind=EdgeWrites, Name="", NameRange on empty (record-form DELETE)

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 ISN (P9.9)
END DEFINE

READ EMPLOYEES
  UPDATE
END

READ VEHICLES
  DELETE
END

END
